# envs/_manifest.example.env
#
# Copy this to `_manifest.local.env` / `_manifest.dev.env` / `_manifest.prod.env`
# and list the components that should run on that host.
#
#     cp _manifest.example.env _manifest.local.env
#
# `deployment/_run.sh` loads the matching `_manifest.<target>.env` and starts
# (only) the components listed here.
#
# Rules:
#   - Space-separated names (not paths). No quotes around individual names.
#   - Each name must correspond to a directory under the matching category:
#       INFERENCES="foo bar" → deployment/inferences/{foo,bar}/
#       NETWORKS="litellm"   → deployment/networks/litellm/
#   - Each listed name also needs envs/<category>/<name>/.env.<target>.
#   - If a name is listed but the directory is missing, `_run.sh` logs a
#     warning and skips it (does not abort the whole run).
#   - Boot order: INFERENCES → NETWORKS (reverse on shutdown).
#   - Names starting with `_` are scaffolding (e.g. _template-vllm) — do
#     NOT list them; they exist only as copy sources.
#   - LiteLLM routing is driven by this list: `render.sh` picks up
#     `deployment/inferences/<name>/litellm.yaml` only for names listed in
#     INFERENCES. Manifest = gateway routing (no drift).

# vLLM / TEI 백엔드. 부팅 순서 = 나열 순서.
# 예시:
#   INFERENCES="qwen3-8b bge-m3"
INFERENCES=""

# 게이트웨이 / 라우터. 마지막에 부팅 (모든 upstream 준비 후).
NETWORKS="litellm"
